      "product_summary": "Breathable Knit Upper:Engineered knitted textile upper creates a light and flexible feel while helping air circulate more easily for daily walking, commuting, and casual all day wear\nComfort Cushioning:EVA midsole and outsole help absorb impact and provide a softer step, while the chunky sole adds stable support and a modern sporty look\nLining Options:Mesh lining supports a lighter wearing experience, and plush fleece lining adds extra comfort for cooler seasons or buyers seeking a warmer in-shoe feel\nEasy Daily Fit:Lace-up closure allows quick adjustment for different foot shapes, and the round toe design gives a more relaxed fit for everyday movement and long hours on your feet\nCustom Ready Supply:Logo customization is supported, and standard shoe box or plastic bag packaging options make this style suitable for retail programs, online sellers, and promotional orders.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear factory supplier based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We serve importers, wholesalers, online sellers and private-label buyers with casual walking shoes and related footwear. Sample review, mixed size and color requirements, and OEM/ODM options can be discussed according to product availability, quantity, materials, logo and packing requirements. Product details and delivery arrangements are confirmed before order placement."
